  "type": "numerical",
  "level": 2,
  "question": {
    "text": "If&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>log</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>log</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mfenced><mrow><msup><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>log</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mfenced><mrow><msup><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi></msup><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>7</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></math>&nbsp;are in an&nbsp;arithmetic progression, then the value of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi></math> is equal&nbsp;to _____.",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [],
  "correctValue": "3",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>As&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>log</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>log</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mfenced><mrow><msup><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>log</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mfenced><mrow><msup><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi></msup><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>7</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></math>&nbsp;are in arithmetic progression,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn><msub><mi>log</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mfenced><mrow><msup><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>log</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>log</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mfenced><mrow><msup><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi></msup><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>7</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msub><mi>log</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><msup><mfenced><mrow><msup><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>log</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mn>2</mn><mfenced><mrow><msup><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi></msup><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>7</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p>Let&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi></msup><mo>=</mo><mi>t</mi></math></p><p>So,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>log</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><msup><mfenced><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>log</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mn>2</mn><mfenced><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>7</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mfenced><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>t</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>7</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mi>t</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>12</mn><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>32</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfenced><mfenced><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>8</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn></math>&nbsp;or&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>8</mn></math></p><p>Here,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8800;</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo></math>&nbsp;as&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>log</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mfenced><mrow><mn>4</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow></mfenced></math>&nbsp;does not exist.&nbsp;</p><p>So,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn></math></p>",
